WEBVTT

00:05:29.565 --> 00:05:32.968
Given that men disproportionately
still have the power,

00:05:32.992 --> 00:05:35.538
we won't see change
unless they work with us

00:05:35.562 --> 00:05:38.808
to create a world that will be better
for men and women.

00:05:39.696 --> 00:05:42.617
JG: Let's talk about
the "glass cliff" phenomenon.

00:05:42.641 --> 00:05:45.625
If a business or
an organization is going well,

00:05:45.649 --> 00:05:47.899
then they're likely
to appoint a new leader

00:05:47.923 --> 00:05:49.938
who looks a lot like the old one --

00:05:49.962 --> 00:05:51.498
that is, a man.

00:05:51.522 --> 00:05:53.249
But if they are in difficulties,

00:05:53.273 --> 00:05:56.594
they decide it's time
to get someone quite different,

00:05:56.618 --> 00:05:58.323
and often reach for a woman.

00:05:58.726 --> 00:05:59.985
To take one example,